cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its evaluation, please cite it as below."
title: "VCL: The Verifiable Context Layer — Reference Implementation and Evaluation"
abstract: >-
  A working reference implementation of the Verifiable Context Layer (VCL) pattern for governing
  enterprise agentic AI outside the model, with a reproducible evaluation: adversarial
  policy-enforcement leak tests across four models, grounding accuracy versus RAG, governance
  latency and scale, tamper-evident auditability, and drift detection.
